{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-24","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平方与比例与整数","englishTitle":"If two numbers have to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number, and the first be square, the second will also be square.","book":8,"number":24,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.24","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.24/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":24,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-24@raw-cf3f69cff3741b60","contentId":"euclid-8-24","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf3f69cff3741b60aeb6405579e87edfe20079510d5dbb5e0d50a43b1c1b82f4","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-24.statement","euclid-8-24.construction.1","euclid-8-24.proof.1","euclid-8-24.proof.2","euclid-8-24.proof.3","euclid-8-24.conclusion","euclid-8-24.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-24.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-24","revisionId":"euclid-8-24@raw-cf3f69cff3741b60","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"14bc33677495b85c539d4680031ca5ae3fa8e1943068b07c2c15f5a4a3805ec7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers have to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number, and the first be square, the second will also be square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个数字之间有平方数到平方数的比,第一个是平方数,第二个也是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-24.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-24","revisionId":"euclid-8-24@raw-cf3f69cff3741b60","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"826d899b9efa6525302019d08d070d24fb5000466d8fd34f0820e0670757e606","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two numbers A, B have to one another the ratio which the square number C has to the square number D, and let A be square; I say that B is also square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B这两个数字必须相互对应,平方数,C对平方数,D的比,A对平方数;我说B也是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-24.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-24","revisionId":"euclid-8-24@raw-cf3f69cff3741b60","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b0bbfe7273e9ee5f4d11d1151869fdf848a504567c409109a7f3842a2bdb92b8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since C, D are square, C, D are similar plane numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,C,D是平方数,C,D是相似平面数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-24.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-24","revisionId":"euclid-8-24@raw-cf3f69cff3741b60","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ed5dfc183509355734a2c61284fdca57b2be54397d0dd5a1dcba8682d9df791","citations":["euclid-8-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore one mean proportional number falls between C, D. [[VIII. 18](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,一个比例中项个数字在C,D之间。 [[VIII. 18](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-24.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-24","revisionId":"euclid-8-24@raw-cf3f69cff3741b60","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dd51016c18a83c487a5f1e6622478a7e9c021f67a1abe152b2b50952272befde","citations":["euclid-8-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as C is to D, so is A to B; therefore one mean proportional number falls between A, B also. [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C比D等于A比B,因此,比例中项的人数也下降了A,B；C 与 D 之比等于 A 与 B 之比。 [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-24.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-24","revisionId":"euclid-8-24@raw-cf3f69cff3741b60","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"31dcfb770de83841eb68603b463a95020a079369e552a7816e71556f8a62330e","citations":["euclid-8-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And A is square; therefore B is also square. [[VIII. 22](/principles/euclid-8-22)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A是平方数,B也是平方数,Q,E,D。 [[VIII. 22](/principles/euclid-8-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-24.source","contentId":"euclid-8-24","revisionId":"euclid-8-24@raw-cf3f69cff3741b60","order":6,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0fafd056a0d81cc3d35e8c4ffcf2f5972d4996f7d48a451d69d32f902e5838b1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.24/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.24\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-8-24:euclid-8-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-24.pro